WEBVTT

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:11.690
Try to land.

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:39.940
What's up?

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.630
Ah, good boy.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:42.880
Sorry, old fella, I didn't know.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.000
That's all right.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:45.620
Get this?

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.310
Just one step makes me sore.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:52.270
The living good doesn't pass up.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:54.810
I get shot off a flea-bitten horse.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.080
Well, I'll be seeing you.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.530
Got the air, I'm gonna run!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:59.980
sent to the post for import sir El Chetan has a large

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.630
shipment of arms for his warring tribes in that prison. He'll return with a horde of Arabs long

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:24.420
before your reinforcements can arrive. Who are you? An enemy of El Chapin. The coming is timely,

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:29.800
El Mavra. French are attacking our strongholds. Does El Chapin ride with us?

00:05:58.510 --> 00:05:59.370
idea you had.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:00.780
This thing

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:13.160
Arab Sentry's on the wall. Our men have beaten off the French.

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:17.330
Firing ceased only a moment ago, yet I see no sign of the French retreating.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:19.260
Wait here.

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:27.740
That's enough. Get all the uniformed men out of sight.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.980
Now, if Al J. Dan does tell me a...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.020
We'll walk right into our trap.

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:35.960
Who's that?

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:40.570
El Cadour, a friend of France.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:41.830
Who's El Cadour?

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:45.440
A very powerful chief whose loyalty is beyond question.

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:47.150
Pass him in, Sentry.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:55.840
Greetings, Captain.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:58.620
Has Miss Elaine Corday arrived at the...

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.000
Elaine?

00:07:59.840 --> 00:07:59.980
Say...

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:06.940
This is Lieutenant Wayne, who has helped us capture a large shipment of arms from El Shaitan.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:10.440
A blow that El Shaitan is not likely to forget.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:12.820
A large band of arms is approaching, Captain.

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:21.400
This is Miss Corday and my men. Open the gate.

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:28.770
Wayne, my child, I fear for your safety.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:29.980
Wayne, what are you doing?

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.250
Don't touch me.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:32.160
Murderer?

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:34.100
Why, Elaine, surely you don't believe it.

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:35.140
I don't have to believe it.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:35.980
I know.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.940
Captain Barncourt, this man murdered my brother.

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:41.000
I demand that you surrender him to me.

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:42.540
Armand Corday dead?

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:44.420
But you can't believe it.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.220
Why should I kill my best friend?

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:48.520
Because he tried to arrest you for gun running.

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:49.160
Gun running?

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.090
My brother's dying sacred.

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:51.980
Read this.

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:07.600
But, Miss Cordell, surely your brother must have been mistaken.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.000
This man had just exposed the gun-running plot of El Chaitan.

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:13.040
Well, perhaps this will convince him.

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:26.580
Lieutenant Wayne, this is an official order for your arrest.

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.800
I cannot ignore it. Put him under guard.

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:34.240
The law will deal with him, my child.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.260
It is my right to avenge my brother's death.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:37.780
Let me go, Alcadur!

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:41.720
The symbol of the devil's circle.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.880
He's not Alcadur, he's Alcadur's hand.

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:45.780
You won't help your case by making me discharges.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:48.410
I told you before that Alcadur's loyalty to France

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:50.460
is beyond question. Take him away.

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:05.560
My men will see you safely home.

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:06.970
I have business elsewhere.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:09.690
I wish I could persuade you to wait until our reinforcements arrive.

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:12.310
The desert is swarming with El Shaitan's men.

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:17.540
I am sure we have nothing to fear from El Shaitan.

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:27.390
The French have sent for reinforcements.

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:28.390
We can't attack them now.

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:29.970
And the shipment of...

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:34.700
I have a plan. Summon a meeting of the devil's circle.

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:56.050
We have a word with the prisoner. Peter Powell.

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:58.040
Yeah, go ahead.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:05.200
One, two, four, one, two, three, four.

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:09.580
Dirty double-crosser.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:10.900
Killing your best friend.

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:13.120
Wilder, the firing squad's too good for you.

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:14.840
Get out of there and break in too!

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:15.740
Pretend you hurt.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.520
Look out, here comes the guard.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:18.720
Guard, no guard up.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:20.980
Hey, what's the matter, you fellas?

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:21.600
Get out of here.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:24.320
I'll be in the suite and Mr. Captain never finds out about this.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:26.240
Well, he had it coming to him.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:29.160
Come on, you guys.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:00.990
Marial detail.

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:02.250
That's for a detail.

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:03.170
Wait a minute.

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:04.390
There's something wrong with my bridal.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:17.860
Here he comes.

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.720
I don't come back without it.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.070
Thanks, boys. Your teamwork's fine.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:59.250
Yeah, but our orders are not to come back without you.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.040
That's too bad, because I'm going after El Cador.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.870
Well, what are we waiting for?

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:04.590
That's right.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:13.600
Come down.

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:29.160
Yes, Miss Cordain.

00:13:29.510 --> 00:13:29.970
Colonel DuBois.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.680
of the foreign legion sent me to see you?

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:32.100
Yes.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:34.750
He told me that your brother left a dying statement

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:36.810
incriminating Lieutenant Wayne as a gun runner.

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:37.660
Yes.

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:40.840
This unfortunate affair has resulted

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.060
in a very serious diplomatic situation.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:46.900
Would it be asking too much to let me see that letter?

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:48.790
I will show you.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.620
How did this letter come into your possession?

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:17.950
By servant Ali, found it after my brother's death.

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:21.280
Thank you, Miss Corday.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:22.930
I won't trouble you any further.

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:26.910
Ali, you made your booze out.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:29.430
Goodbye, and thank you very much.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:29.840
Goodbye.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:45.310
I thought that letter has been cut off. What did you do with it?

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:47.940
I do not understand.

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:11.660
No, you intended to use this to blackmail El Shaitan.

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.580
I... have mercy!

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:17.520
You know what happens to those who betray El Shaitan.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.260
Nothing. Nothing.

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:06.330
Looks like he's going into that cave.

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.790
That must be where the devil's circle meets.

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:10.760
We've got to get in there now.

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:14.500
Since we can't get by that mob, let's see if there's another way in.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:27.930
President, all but one, Master.

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:29.150
We'll wait.

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:43.360
This looks like the entrance to something.

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:46.620
Bernard and I will go down while you two keep watch up here.

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:17.840
I have important news by El Cador.

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.750
You may pass, Miss Corday.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:45.460
the purpose of this meeting.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:50.700
The loss of the armed chaplain at Fort Moray today was a severe growth of them.

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:55.380
Who is this?

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:57.070
And why was she permitted to enter here?

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.210
The Spiders!

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:04.500
Good boy!

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:12.290
Quick, pour me down.

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:19.980
You need to break the door down.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:26.500
Stop pushing as I can.

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:28.120
Don't fool yourself.

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:28.700
It's a trick.

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:39.000
The dump shoes! They're sending it! Get out! Quick!

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:47.210
No, I can't reach them.
